{"ID":"20240206105658-xudzapw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206105658-xudzapw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105658-xudzapw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105705-ht976jq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105701-hityjs4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105705-ht976jq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:184,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:184\u0026#125;","title":" 委陵菜","type":"doc","updated":"20240830101650"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240708124256-gyyol8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708124256-gyyol8g","updated":"20240708124257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"朝天委陵菜"}]},{"ID":"20240206105705-ht976jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105705-ht976jq","updated":"20240206105708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、吉林、辽宁、山东等地。\n【性状】\t该品根呈圆柱形或类圆锥形，略扭曲，有的有分枝，长517cm，直径0.51cm；表面暗棕色或暗紫红色，有纵纹，粗皮易成片状剥落；根头部稍膨大；质硬，易折断，断面皮部薄，暗棕色，常与木部分离，射线呈放射状排列。叶基生，单数羽状复叶，有柄；小叶狭长椭圆形，边缘羽状深裂，下表面及叶柄均密被灰白色柔毛。气微，味涩、微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，凉血止痢。用于赤痢腹痛，久痢不止，痔疮出血，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105701-hityjs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105701-hityjs4","updated":"20240206105701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105701-g0hndnn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708103811-qbmrnaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708103811-qbmrnaf","updated":"20240708103811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 539px;","style":"width: 529px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜4-20240708103811-bpdnhrw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 529px;\" parent-style=\"width: 539px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708104231-ai3xu15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708104231-ai3xu15","updated":"20240829171517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 621px;","style":"width: 611px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜5-20240708103959-3f0mjdx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 611px;\" parent-style=\"width: 621px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜7-20240708104231-6etvluc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708105520-llhzoyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708105520-llhzoyj","updated":"20240829171519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜9-20240708122443-aavztzk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 757px;","style":"width: 747px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜6-20240708104157-3oukwi1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 747px;\" parent-style=\"width: 757px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708122444-zl1sp8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708122444-zl1sp8x","updated":"20240708124339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜10-20240708122632-yjxez4e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 459px;","style":"width: 449px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜12"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜12-20240708123031-85pbhzm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 449px;\" parent-style=\"width: 459px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240708124149-osm3ksx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708124149-osm3ksx","updated":"20240708124152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708124149-950sseb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829171523-sdd3o97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829171523-sdd3o97","updated":"20240829171523"}},{"ID":"20240708124458-kou04xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708124458-kou04xw","updated":"20240708124503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三叶委陵菜"}]},{"ID":"20240708124501-xkl6409","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708124501-xkl6409","updated":"20240708125209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 345px;","style":"width: 335px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜2-20240708103051-bshawqx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 335px;\" parent-style=\"width: 345px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三叶委陵菜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三叶委陵菜-20240708125209-h7ylm74.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829171525-0o2oppl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829171525-0o2oppl","updated":"20240829171525"}},{"ID":"20240708123906-w01cv85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708123906-w01cv85","updated":"20240708123957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇含委陵菜"}]},{"ID":"20240708124014-64oscwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708124014-64oscwx","updated":"20240708124453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜1-20240708103021-eykm3uy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 537px;","style":"width: 527px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜13"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜13-20240708123127-olsbqns.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 527px;\" parent-style=\"width: 537px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708123945-ii1k3j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708123945-ii1k3j6","updated":"20240708124926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛇含萎陵菜1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛇含萎陵菜1-20240708124904-5c25rec.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 550px;","style":"width: 540px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"委陵菜11"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/委陵菜11-20240708122928-oh1j1bz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 540px;\" parent-style=\"width: 550px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708122948-h7bnecu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708122948-h7bnecu","updated":"20240708123007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：品种较多，仅提供部分照片作参考。"}]},{"ID":"20240830094550-o1t9pfa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830094550-o1t9pfa"}},{"ID":"20240830101643-t98n4ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-t98n4ph","updated":"20240830101650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：委陵菜"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-a9ka0fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-a9ka0fm","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"委陵菜《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-qpm9dvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-qpm9dvy","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WěiLínɡCài"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-skj0c5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-skj0c5k","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBAPOTENTILLAECHINENSIS"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-pjf56u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-pjf56u0","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】毛鸡腿子、野鸡膀子、蛤蟆草、山萝卜、翻白草[山东]、白头翁[湖北]"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-9tpsddf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-9tpsddf","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为蔷薇科植物委陵菜PotentillachinensisSer.的干燥全草。春季未抽茎时采挖，除去泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-0ezjdqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-0ezjdqp","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品根呈圆柱形或类圆锥形，略扭曲，有的有分枝，长5～17cm，直径0.5～1cm；表面暗棕色或暗紫红色，有纵纹，粗皮易成片状剥落；根头部稍膨大；质硬，易折断，断面皮部薄，暗棕色，常与木部分离，射线呈放射状排列。叶基生，单数羽状复叶，有柄；小叶狭长椭圆形，边缘羽状深裂，下表面及叶柄均密被灰白色柔毛。气微，味涩、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-82g95mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-82g95mn","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-gzuwg7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-gzuwg7p","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末灰褐色。非腺毛极多，单细胞，平直或弯曲，有的缠结成团，细长，直径7～37μm，长约至4000μm，壁厚。草酸钙簇晶存在于叶肉组织中，直径6～65μm，偶有小方晶。木纤维长梭形，直径7～14μm，壁稍厚，孔沟明显。木栓细胞类多角形或扁长方形，内含黄棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-fd9i901","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-fd9i901","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加石油醚（60～90℃）10ml,温浸3小时，滤过，滤液挥干，加乙醇10ml使溶解，滤过，滤液浓缩至约1ml,作为供试品溶液。另取委陵菜对照药材1g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验。吸取上述两种溶液各6μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以甲苯－甲酸乙酯－甲酸（5:4:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以2％三氯化铁溶液与铁氰化钾试液的等量混合溶液。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同的蓝色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-inmkan2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-inmkan2","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，洗净，润透，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-p98r5cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-p98r5cv","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-befu9hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-befu9hn","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-j4b575q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-j4b575q","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒，凉血止痢。用于赤痢腹痛，久痢不止，痔疮出血，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-f55f4b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-f55f4b3","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～15g。外用鲜品适量，煎水洗或捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-8qr46xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-8qr46xb","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-j67hpc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-j67hpc4","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）同属植物粘委陵菜PotentillaviscosaDonn，西藏以全草作委陵菜入药功效类似。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-75rjars","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-75rjars","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-2scqlwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-2scqlwv","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"委陵菜《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-eis8j1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-eis8j1m","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《救荒本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-wlp26xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-wlp26xz","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WěiLínɡCài"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-sckdpoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-sckdpoa","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】翻白菜（《救荒本草》），根头菜，野鸩旁花（《植物名汇》），黄州白头翁（《中国药植志》），龙牙草（《南京民间药草》），天青地白、小毛药、虎爪菜（《贵州民间方药集》），蛤蟆草（《东北药植志》），老鸦翎、老鸦瓜（《山东中药》），地区草（呼和浩特市《医药卫生》（3）：42，1972）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-i92maq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-i92maq1","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为蔷薇科植物委陵菜的根或带根全草。4～10月间采收。将带根全草除去花枝及果枝，晒干。或将地上部分茎叶全部除去，仅用其根。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-2f1enl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-2f1enl5","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高30～60厘米。根肥大，圆锥状。茎直立，密生灰白色绵毛。单数羽状复叶，基生叶有小叶8～11对，顶端小叶最大，两侧小叶向下渐次变小，小叶狭长椭圆形，长2～5厘米，宽8～15毫米，边缘羽状深裂。裂片三角状披针形，边缘向下反卷，上面被短柔毛，下面密生白绵毛；托叶长披针形至椭圆状披针形，全缘残羽状裂，密被长绵毛；茎生叶与根生叶同形而较小，小叶1～7对。花多数，顶生，呈伞房状豪伞花序；花萼5裂，裂片广卵形，副萼5片，披针形至线形，均有白绵毛；花瓣5，黄色，倒卵状圆形，凹头；雄蕊多敷，花丝不等长，花药黄色；雌蕊多数，聚生，子房卵形而小。微扁，花柱侧生，柱头小。瘦果卵圆形，长约2毫米，褐色，光滑，包于宿存花萼内。花期6～8月。果期8～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-1p4xbyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-1p4xbyy","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山坡、路边、田旁、山林草丛中。全国大部分地区有分布。主产于山东、辽宁、安徽。此外，河北、河南、内蒙古、湖北、江苏、广西、福建等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-clp622q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-clp622q","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为干燥的根或带根的全草，根圆柱形，偶有弯曲，长短不一，直径0.5～1厘米，外表红棕色或暗棕色，具有不规则的纵裂纹，栓皮多呈片状剥落；质坚硬，折断面不平坦，皮部与木部极易分离，皮部淡红棕色，木部棕白色。根头部较粗大，并丛生多数黄棕色的叶基部分；羽状复叶，皱缩，小叶多向内对折，边缘向外反卷，背面的绵毛密而长。气微弱，味微苦而涩。以干燥、无花茎，无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-dfdk28e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-dfdk28e","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】新鲜植物含水分62.39％，抗坏血酸49.4毫克％。干品含水分12.12％、蛋白质9.18％、脂肪4.03％，粗纤维21.89％、灰分7.25％、P2O5-0.26％、Ca0-2.63％。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-4370n29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-4370n29","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】委陵菜对溶组织阿米巴原虫的作用较白头翁为弱，参见\"白头翁\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-x5h0uzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-x5h0uzv","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ny698vf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ny698vf","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ajjgn38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ajjgn38","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《救荒本草》：\"味苦微辣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-yet71kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-yet71kb","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《山东中药》：\"味微苦，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-gq26sat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-gq26sat","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《贵阳民间药草》：\"涩苦，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-uh1fiwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-uh1fiwb","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-4cp056m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-4cp056m","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛风湿，解毒。治痢疾，风湿筋骨疼痛，瘫痪，癫痫，疮疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-rqm75rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-rqm75rz","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《中国药植志》：\"治阿米巴痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-r0yxwjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-r0yxwjf","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《贵州民间方药集》：\"治痢疾，母猪疯，羊癫疯。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-67opzye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-67opzye","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《东北药植志》：\"煎汤洗疥疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-8lqgz3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-8lqgz3l","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《贵阳民间药草》：\"清热解毒。治赤白痢下，风湿疼痛，瘫痪。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-rjshdzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-rjshdzv","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，0.5～1两；研末或浸酒。外用：煎水洗，捣敷或研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-zt5mjoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-zt5mjoa","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-x84m830","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-x84m830","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治痢疾：天青地白根五钱。煎水服，一日三、四次，服二、三日。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-2y86hmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-2y86hmy","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治久痢不止：天青地白、白木槿花各五钱，煎水吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-7iexqgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-7iexqgd","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治赤痢腹痛：天青地白细末五分。开水吞服，饭前服用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-gvzrbze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-gvzrbze","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治风湿麻木瘫痪，筋骨久痛：天青地白、大风藤、五香血藤、兔耳风各半斤，泡酒连续服用，每日早晚各服一两。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-1zubibo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-1zubibo","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治风瘫：天青地白（鲜）一斤。泡酒二斤，每次服一、二两。第二次用量同样。另加何首乌一两（痛加指甲花根二两）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-qqyxwnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-qqyxwnn","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疔疮初起：天青地白根一两。煎水服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-n7u2ykk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-n7u2ykk","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦刀伤止血生肌：天青地白叶（干）研末外擞；或鲜根捣烂外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-qpl9kmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-qpl9kmf","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治癫痫：天青地白根（去心）一两，白矾三钱。加酒浸泡，温热内服，连发连服，服后再服白矾粉一钱。（选方出《贵阳民间药草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-075dmra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-075dmra","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-hju359w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-hju359w","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗出血性疾病"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-4fg1wu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-4fg1wu6","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取新鲜地区草全草2～4两（干品0.5～1两）切碎，水煎2次，两次煎液混合，加入少量红糖再煎片刻，2次分服，每日一剂，必要时可续服1～2剂。临床观察子宫功能性出血、月经过多、鼻出血、咯血、血尿和部分癌症出血共112例，结果治愈66例，有效29例。其中对妇科疾病的治疗效果最为满意，内科疾病次之。本品的止血作用以根部最强，如一例大咯血患者服干根1两，次日咯血停止。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-33r0g0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-33r0g0t","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗急性细菌性痢疾"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-qa2rpde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-qa2rpde","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取委陵菜干根制成20％溶液，每次60毫升，每日口服2次。或制成20％注射液供肌肉注射，首次2毫升，以后逐渐增至3.5毫升，每日1～2次。不论口服或注射，均同时用20％溶液60毫升，行保留灌肠，每日1～2次。用药2～10天不等。临床用注射剂治疗52例，治愈49例，好转3例，每例平均总剂量为3.4克；口服3例，治愈2例，好转1例，每例平均总剂量为82克；肌注加口服治疗9例，治愈8例，好转1例，每例平均总剂量为59.8克。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-6sez5ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-6sez5ms","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗阿米巴痢疾将委陵菜根茎制成煎剂或流浸膏服用。成人每日量为20～30克（以生药计算）。3次分服。少数患者并用10％煎液100毫升行保留灌肠。7～10日为一疗程，必要时休息1、2日再行第二疗程。临床治疗27例，其中包括急性、慢性和慢性隐伏期急性发作者。服药后。发热病例体温均迅违下降，腹痛、里急后重、腹泻及粘液便大多在1～4天消失，大便镜检病原体平均转阴时间为3天。8例经追踪观察，其中1例于1月后复发。因此认为对慢性隐伏性患者，应给予反复彻底的治疗。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-5pxpy28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-5pxpy28","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】本品在大部分地区作翻白草入药；少数地区作白头翁使用，称为\"黄州白头翁\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-3ib8hau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-3ib8hau","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-b19gt48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-b19gt48","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"委陵菜《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-yt8h6ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-yt8h6ea","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《救荒本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-kz91lf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-kz91lf6","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】WěiLínɡCài"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-bw6t8ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-bw6t8ml","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】ChineseCinquefoilHerb,HerbofChineseCinquefoil"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-354kixz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-354kixz","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】翻白菜、白头翁、根头菜、野鸠旁花、黄州白头翁、龙牙草、天青地白、小毛药、虎爪菜、蛤蟆草、老鸦翎、老鸦爪、地区草、翻白草、野鸡脖子、痢疾草"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-17x484z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-17x484z","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-nlk9why","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-nlk9why","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蔷薇科植物委陵菜的带根全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-jbug13c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-jbug13c","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：PotentillachinensisSer."}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-1uyo3jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-1uyo3jh","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：4-10月间采挖带根全草，除去花枝与果枝，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-xh1dxk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-xh1dxk1","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】委陵菜多年生草本，高20-70cm。根粗壮，圆柱状，稍木质化。花茎直立或上升，被疏稀短柔毛及白色娟大辩论长柔毛。基生叶为羽状复叶；总叶柄被短毛及绢状长柔毛；托叶近膜质，褐色，外被白色绢状长柔毛；小叶5-15对，对生或互生，上部小叶较长，向下渐变短，无柄；小叶片长圆形，倒卵形或长圆披针形，长1-5cm，宽0.5-1.5cm，先端急尖或圆钝，边缘羽状中裂，裂片三角卵形、三角状披针形或长圆披针形，边缘向下反卷，上面被短柔毛或近无毛，中脉下陷，下面被生白绒毛，沿脉被白色绢状长柔毛；茎生叶与基生叶相似，唯叶片对数较少，托叶草质，边缘通常呈齿牙状分裂。花两性；伞房状聚伞花序，花茎被白色绢状长柔毛，花序基部有披针形苞片，外密被短柔毛；花直径0.8-1cm，稀达1.3cm；萼片5，三角卵形，先端急尖，花后不增大，紧贴果实，副萼5片，比萼片短约1倍，且狭窄，外被短柔毛及少数绢状柔毛；花瓣5，宽倒卵形，先端微凹，比萼片稍长，黄色；花柱近顶生，柱头扩大。瘦果卵球形，深褐色，有明显皱纹。花、果期4-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-d9xw0n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-d9xw0n2","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ut56mg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ut56mg5","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔400-3200m的山坡、草地、沟谷、林缘、灌丛及疏林下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-0iywjkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-0iywjkm","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、中南、西南及陕西、甘肃、山东、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、台湾、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-rsjk1fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-rsjk1fn","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-lxet6sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-lxet6sa","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.气候土壤：宜温和干燥的气候，以排水良好的砂质壤土为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-xumtplc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-xumtplc","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.整地：播种前翻耕土地1-2次，并施厩肥或堆肥，作畦宽约1.5m。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-pqaiidc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-pqaiidc","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.种植：3月下旬，在畦面开沟，深6-7cm，沟距18-21cm，然后将种子与细土混和，疏播在沟中，覆土一层，浇水。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ib0rr5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ib0rr5x","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.播种后约3周出苗，当苗高3-6cm时匀苗，使每株相距12-15cm。以后每隔15天左右，除草松土1次。追肥第1次在幼苗期，第2次在生长花蕾前，前者以氮肥为主，后者以磷钾肥为主。干旱严重时须灌水。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-psfwjs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-psfwjs4","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-v6ezr6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-v6ezr6x","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别根圆柱形或类圆锥形，略扭曲，有的分枝，长5-17cm，直径0.5-1cm；表面暗棕色或暗紫红色，有纵纹，粗皮易成片状剥落；根头部稍膨大；质坚，易折断，断面皮部薄，暗棕色，常与木部分离，射线呈放射状排列。叶基生，单数羽状复叶，有柄；小叶狭长椭圆形，边缘羽状深裂，下面及叶柄均密被灰白色柔毛。气微，味涩，微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-m9ye8g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-m9ye8g7","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以无花茎、色灰白、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-72leggk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-72leggk","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别叶横切面：上表皮细胞类方形，下表皮细胞切向延长；上下表皮有多数单细胞非腺毛，以下表皮尤密，且多弯曲。栅栏组织为2-3列细胞，有的含草酸钙簇晶，直径8-37μm；海绵组织为数列类圆形细胞。主脉极向下凸起，维管束外韧型，木质部半月形，韧皮部呈新月形，外侧有厚角组织，上下表皮内方有2-4列厚角细胞。粉末特征：灰褐色。①非腺毛极多，单细胞，平直或弯曲，有的缠结成团，细长，长约至4000μm，直径7-37μm，壁极厚或较厚。②草酸钙簇晶存在于叶肉组织中，簇晶直径6-65μm，偶有方晶。③木纤维长梭形，直径7-14μm，壁稍厚，纹孔明显。④木栓细胞类多角形或扁长方形，内含黄棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-0b07v71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-0b07v71","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全草含槲皮素(quercetin)、山柰素(kaempferol)和没食子酸(gallicacid)，壬二酸(anchoicacid)，3，3ˊ，4ˊ-三-O-甲基并没食子酸(3,3ˊ，4ˊ-tri-O-methylellagicacid)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ywxtrte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ywxtrte","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ktfwrgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ktfwrgb","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗病原体作用委陵菜中含有的没食子酸、槲皮素具有抗菌活性。另外含有的抗菌成分壬二酸对福氏痢疾杆菌2a的抑菌直径为21mm，对志贺痢疾杆菌抑菌直径为14mm，对宋内痢疾杆菌为12mm。全草煎剂用平板打洞法，对痢疾村菌有抑制作用。根煎剂每日以3g/kg给感染阿米巴的大鼠灌胃，连续6d，对体内溶组织阿米巴原虫有一定抑制作用，但体外无效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-8pjqjz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-8pjqjz2","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.其他作用叶及根煎剂1：5000-1：25对离体蛙、兔心脏呈抑制作用，对兔离体及在体肠管亦有抑制作用；还可扩张豚鼠离体支气管，兴奋豚鼠离体子宫。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-fg261k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-fg261k9","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.毒性根流浸膏小鼠灌胃的LD/50为60g/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-2uafq33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-2uafq33","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品粗粉0.5g，加乙醇10ml，回流提取2h，滤过，取滤液1ml于试管中，滴加1%三氯化铁乙醇试液1滴，呈墨绿色。（检查鞣质）"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-aq2rnds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-aq2rnds","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-pfsxrkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-pfsxrkz","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.净制：除去杂质、洗净、晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-4jw4sme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-4jw4sme","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.切制：切段。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-b8wzyo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-b8wzyo5","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-9yxoa8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-9yxoa8n","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；脾；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-d5iw6qg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-d5iw6qg","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】凉血止痢，清热解毒。主久痢不止，赤痢腹痛，痔疮出血，疮痈肿毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-8yn060c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-8yn060c","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15-30g；或研末或浸酒。外用：适量，煎水洗，或捣敷，或研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-msluuji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-msluuji","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】慢性腹泻伴体虚者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-cihfl0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-cihfl0k","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-rpt2r8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-rpt2r8e","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《中国药植志》：治阿米巴痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-4khlcwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-4khlcwx","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《贵州民间方药集》：治痢疾，母猪疯，羊癫疯。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-qpo6kcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-qpo6kcl","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《东北药植志》：煎汤洗疥疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-ak9aea9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-ak9aea9","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《贵阳民间药草》：清热解毒。治赤白痢下，风湿疼痛，瘫痪。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101643-iwlknwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101643-iwlknwq","updated":"20240830101658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101644-e8sexqj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830101644-e8sexqj","updated":"20240830101658"}},{"ID":"20240830101645-neqxrg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101645-neqxrg3","updated":"20240830101658"}}]}